l\", with the help of some new friends. But as the era changes, the bond between Maquia and Ariel changes too, amidst a backdrop of racial tensions between the Iorph and the Mezarte. This is a story of irreplaceable time, woven by two lonely people who can only find solace in each other.\n\n(Source: Eleven Arts)"},"tags":[{"name":"Parenthood","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":99,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Adoption","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Orphan","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":83,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Travel","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fugitive","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rural","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":55,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Dragons","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Assassins","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Arranged Marriage","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Pregnancy","rank":48,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Espionage","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Photography","rank":42,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rape","rank":38,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Maquia: When the Promised Flower Blooms","english":"Maquia: When the Promised Flower Blooms","native":"さよならの朝に約束の花をかざろう","romaji":"Sayonara no Asa ni Yakusoku no Hana wo Kazarou","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"朝花夕誓——于离别之朝束起约定之花"},{"language":null,"source":"bangum